Course Overview
This is ReactJS - The Beginner Masterclass, designed to teach you React fundamentals and intermediate concepts through hands-on project building.

The course emphasizes practical learning by building real React projects as you progress through the material.

Course Prerequisites
To get the most out of this course, you should have basic knowledge of:

HTML — Understand the basics of how front-end websites are written.
You don't need to be a designer or HTML expert, just know the fundamentals.

CSS (Cascading Style Sheets) — Basic understanding of styling web pages.

JavaScript — Core programming knowledge in JavaScript is essential.

Who This Course Is For
✅ React beginners — If you don't know React yet, this is the perfect place to start.

✅ Not necessarily programming beginners — You don't need to be a professional programmer, but you should have some general programming experience.

✅ All skill levels — The instructor explains concepts slowly and in detail, especially at the beginning, so whether you're just starting or have some experience, you'll find value in this course.

Learning Approach
The course focuses on hands-on project building rather than just theory.

You'll learn by doing, which is emphasized as the best way to master new React concepts.
